'!FABMO!name: USER_ADDS
'!FABMO!description: beta: Added user variables & Macros
'!FABMO!enabled:true
' Name: USER_ADDS
' Description: beta: Added user variables & Macros
' 2026/8/15

' This file is the initial test of a system to allow for a maintenance of persistent user variables,
'     configuration changes, and custom macros. In the future, all Macros above #300 will be
'     reserved for user-defined macros and not over-written by new FabMo updates.

' The idea will be that macro 301 will be automatically read along with 201, but will only conatin user set
'     variables or initiations. This file will not be overwritten by FabMo updates, but should be save when
'     user profiles are created.
' Macros above 301 will also be reserved for user-defined macros and should not be modified by FabMo updates.
